#: ../../resources_page.rst:22
msgid "Resources"
msgstr "Zdroje"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:24
msgid ""
"Note that, in addition to the resources listed below, the `\"Resources\" "
"category of krita-artists.org <https://krita-artists.org/c/resources/10/l/"
"top>`_ is probably the best place to find new brush packs, textures, and "
"other Krita resources. The community is very active and is always adding new "
"and interesting content."
msgstr ""
"Upozorňujeme, že okrem zdrojov uvedených nižšie je kategória `\"Resources\" "
"na krita-artists.org <https://krita-artists.org/c/resources/10/l/top>`_ "
"pravdepodobne najlepším miestom na nájdenie nových balíkov štetcov, textúr a "
"iných zdrojov pre Krita. Komunita je veľmi aktívna a neustále pridáva nový a "
"zaujímavý obsah."

#: ../../resources_page.rst:26
msgid ""
"Additionally, the `official Krita YouTube channel <https://www.youtube.com/"
"@KritaOrgPainting>`_ often features new brush packs, complete with demos and "
"free downloads."
msgstr ""
"Okrem toho `oficiálny kanál Krita na YouTube <https://www.youtube.com/"
"@KritaOrgPainting>`_ často prezentuje nové balíky štetcov spolu s ukážkami a "
"bezplatnými stiahnutiami."

